    "detailed_description": "<strong><i>Clipped, the duck that lost its wings!</i></strong> Is a challenging platformer that tests the skill of the most veteran platformer. Immerse yourself in the unique surroundings of this magical world. Reach the top and find the answer to all these questions...<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1243930/extras/27b7f94687dd182c96c1ebd4fb9399b4.poster.avif?t=1585325180\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1243930/extras/27b7f94687dd182c96c1ebd4fb9399b4.webm?t=1585325180\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1243930/extras/27b7f94687dd182c96c1ebd4fb9399b4.mp4?t=1585325180\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Gameplay:</h2>Get ready to challenge yourself in a true high-stakes platforming challenge, where even the tiniest mistake can be your biggest undoings.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1243930/extras/2b8ca2191c66c25e838d332abdea533a.poster.avif?t=1585325180\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1243930/extras/2b8ca2191c66c25e838d332abdea533a.webm?t=1585325180\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1243930/extras/2b8ca2191c66c25e838d332abdea533a.mp4?t=1585325180\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Leap from platform to platform using your gun, propelling yourself in your desired direction.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1243930/extras/fe6cba0483142b212bf4909129bb8311.avif?t=1585325180\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The World:</h2>This world may seem normal at first, just like home infact, but if you take a closer look you'll notice a lot of things that just do not make sense. Venture forward and discover items, secrets and new paths into defeating this cruel world once and for all!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1243930/extras/0e5fd824c071ca8ab5ff346e66c25c73.avif?t=1585325180\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Simple to learn, hard to master!<br></li><li>360 aim, to hit your perfect angle!<br></li><li>Charge your gun, to get the perfect distance!<br></li><li>Explore the world for secrets and special items!<br></li><li>Different guns for different people!<br></li><li>Save your progress and continue after a small break!<br></li><li>Minimalist graphics, pixel art and simple geometry!<br></li><li>Playable with a controller</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<strong><i>Clipped, the duck that lost its wings!</i></strong> Is a challenging platformer that tests the skill of the most veteran platformer. Immerse yourself in the unique surroundings of this magical world. Reach the top and find the answer to all these questions...<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1243930/extras/27b7f94687dd182c96c1ebd4fb9399b4.poster.avif?t=1585325180\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1243930/extras/27b7f94687dd182c96c1ebd4fb9399b4.webm?t=1585325180\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1243930/extras/27b7f94687dd182c96c1ebd4fb9399b4.mp4?t=1585325180\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Gameplay:</h2>Get ready to challenge yourself in a true high-stakes platforming challenge, where even the tiniest mistake can be your biggest undoings.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1243930/extras/2b8ca2191c66c25e838d332abdea533a.poster.avif?t=1585325180\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1243930/extras/2b8ca2191c66c25e838d332abdea533a.webm?t=1585325180\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1243930/extras/2b8ca2191c66c25e838d332abdea533a.mp4?t=1585325180\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Leap from platform to platform using your gun, propelling yourself in your desired direction.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1243930/extras/fe6cba0483142b212bf4909129bb8311.avif?t=1585325180\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The World:</h2>This world may seem normal at first, just like home infact, but if you take a closer look you'll notice a lot of things that just do not make sense. Venture forward and discover items, secrets and new paths into defeating this cruel world once and for all!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1243930/extras/0e5fd824c071ca8ab5ff346e66c25c73.avif?t=1585325180\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Simple to learn, hard to master!<br></li><li>360 aim, to hit your perfect angle!<br></li><li>Charge your gun, to get the perfect distance!<br></li><li>Explore the world for secrets and special items!<br></li><li>Different guns for different people!<br></li><li>Save your progress and continue after a small break!<br></li><li>Minimalist graphics, pixel art and simple geometry!<br></li><li>Playable with a controller</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "The simple life of a duck may not be so simple after all.. Something terrible has happened and it is up to YOU to figure out what's wrong, but what lies ahead will be a serious challenge, the tiniest mistakes can be your biggest accidents.",
